---
/** Registered on TinaMarkdown's `blockquote` override — a `>` in a post's
 * body becomes the mockup's centered pull-quote treatment. */
---

<div class="my-12 pt-4 pb-2 text-center">
  <div class="font-display text-[3.4rem] leading-none text-ink opacity-[.22]">"</div>
  <p class="mt-1.5 font-display text-[clamp(20px,3vw,26px)] leading-[1.4] text-ink italic">
    <slot />
  </p>
</div>
